# Athos Commerce

> Athos Commerce is an ecommerce software company that provides an AI-powered product discovery platform for online retailers, built primarily for mid-market Shopify merchants with $5M to $100M in annual revenue.

## About This Site

Athos Commerce combines onsite search, personalization, merchandising, and product feed management in one platform. It serves ecommerce merchants selling on Shopify, Magento, BigCommerce, and Miva, and supports multi-channel selling across marketplaces, social platforms, shopping engines, and AI platforms. Visitors can review product capabilities, compare Athos to other discovery vendors, read case studies by industry, view plans, and request a demo or pricing.

