## Important Entities

Athos Commerce: ecommerce product discovery platform
Searchspring, Klevu, Intelligent Reach: the brands combined to form Athos Commerce
Product Discovery AI: intent-based search, personalization, and recommendations
Product Feed Management: feed auditing, optimization, and syndication to 1,400+ destinations
AI Agents: Conversational Assistant, Channel Assistant, GEO Assistant
Ecommerce platform integrations: Shopify, Magento, BigCommerce, Miva

## Entity Mapping

Search → shoppers cannot find relevant products onsite → ecommerce manager, head of digital
Personalization → generic experiences lower conversion rate → ecommerce manager, CRO owner
Merchandising → product placement is manual and slow to test → merchandiser, ecommerce manager
Product Feed Management → listings are incomplete or rejected across channels → paid media manager, ecommerce director
Channel Assistant → feed errors go undetected across Google, social, marketplaces → performance marketing manager
GEO Assistant → products are not surfaced in AI shopping tools → ecommerce director, founder
Conversational Assistant → shoppers need guidance before purchase → ecommerce manager
Analytics → discovery performance and ROI are hard to prove → ecommerce director, digital leadership

## Site Purpose

Users evaluate onsite search, personalization, merchandising, and feed management software for an existing online store.
The site supports vendor comparison, platform fit checks, industry validation through case studies, and pricing or demo requests.
It addresses low onsite conversion, poor product findability, manual merchandising work, and product listings that underperform across marketplaces, social channels, and AI platforms.
It serves buyers who own revenue and conversion targets at small and mid-size ecommerce businesses.

